			"notes": "### Added\n- **Tags** in every registry list, so you can select whole groups at once (all logs, all boats, ...).\n- **Enchantment conditions** for hand items, including an \"is it enchanted at all\" toggle.\n- **Player conditions**: elytra flying, swimming, game mode, health and hunger thresholds.\n- **Waterlogged** condition for target blocks.\n- **Regex** mode for custom name filtering.\n\n### Changed\n- Durability now lets you pick **Above** or **Below** the threshold instead of only below.\n- Spectator mode is no longer hardcoded off — it's part of the new game mode condition now."
